Package: gotNeRve
Title: Predict Stromal Tumor-Associated Nerve (STaN) Abundance from Gene Expression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Cailin", "Deiter", , "cailin.deiter@cuanschutz.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a gene expression-based classifier for predicting
    high or low stromal tumor-associated nerve (STaN) abundance in
    non-muscle-invasive bladder cancer. The bundled elastic-net model uses
    a 12-gene transcriptomic signature developed from bulk RNA-sequencing
    of tumors with matched image-based STaN quantification. Includes
    gotNeRve() for scoring raw counts, CPM, or log2-CPM gene expression data.
